WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
How scams work: the 4 steps almost every scam follows.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.800
Step 1, contact. A call, SMS, email or message from someone you don't know.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.200
Step 2, pressure. "Act now!" Fear, urgency or a prize makes you rush.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.600
Step 3, payment. They ask for your PIN, a code, or money sent to a stranger.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.000
Step 4, vanish. The scammer disappears and the money is gone.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Stop. Verify. Report. Pause, confirm on an official number, and tell your bank and the police.
